docker run -d `
  --name inventory-redis `
  -p 6379:6379 `
  redis:7-alpine

docker exec -it inventory-redis redis-cli ping

PING
SET product:1 "Laptop"
GET product:1
EXPIRE product:1 300
TTL product:1
DEL product:1
KEYS *

Command	Purpose
PING	Check Redis connection
SET	Store a key-value pair
GET	Retrieve a value
EXPIRE	Set expiration
TTL	Check remaining lifetime
DEL	Delete a key